request ranges v1 "Range request"
description "A form whose ranges have every kind of end (fictional rules): an end that is in and one that is out, of a number a person enters, of a count of rows, of a computation in a row, of a sum and of a computation of a sum"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"

form
  rate   : number "Rate"  range >0 <10
  lines  : rows "Lines"  count >=2 <=3
    price : money[JPY] "Price"  range >=1JPY <=1_000JPY
    fee   : money[JPY] "Fee" = price * 2  range <1_500JPY
  total  : money[JPY] "Total" = sum(lines.price)  range >=10JPY <2_000JPY
  double : money[JPY] "Double" = total * 2  range >20JPY <=3_000JPY

route
  first  manager

who
  manager = manager of requester

every stage
  due in 3 business days at end of day
  when late escalate, then expire
  when empty escalate, then skip

ticket
  self approval  not allowed

scenario inside_every_range
  requester e1201
  form rate = 5, lines = [{price: 500JPY}, {price: 500JPY}]
| at               | event   | by    | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-11-16 10:00 | submit  | e1201 | first    | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 11:00 | approve | e1101 |          | approved    |
